'''Pt. 1: A Decade of Memories''' (第1部 10年の軌跡パレード, ''Dai Ichibu 10 Nen no Kiseki Parēdo'', '''Part 1 Parade of 10 Years''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that was added in [[Version 11.10 Update|Version 11.10]].

==Overview==
===About===
The Pt. 1: A Decade of Memories Gauntlet contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] stages. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

